OL,3,AChina advises its citizens to leave
OL,4,ATaiwan ally Eswatini over 'security
OL,5,Arisks'
OL,6,
OL,7,FEswatini is one of 12 countries, and
OL,8,Fthe only one in Africa, that has
OL,9,Fdiplomatic relations with Taiwan, which
OL,10,FChina claims as part of its territory.
